        {
            "author_association": "NONE",
            "body": "like I said, I see the exact same issue in 2 different terminal that supports tmux control mode (wezterm-nightly and chromeos's default terminal), so it's much less likely this is a terminal issue and more likely this is a neovim issue.\n\nI just highlight wezterm here because it's the one easier for other to reproduce (as chromeos's default terminal is only available to chromeos that most people don't have access to).\n\nhttps://issuetracker.google.com/issues/476328785 was the issue I filed before with chromeos (I wasn't using wezterm then so I thought it was a terminal issue).",
